":"tformat","target":"%s材质等级 %d：%s#LAST#\n%s"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"1a73b279dc7d397fcb7fd9906c552eda253af79596063edc8501a70eddad1f16","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"cc3be42bc9ba8e912213608311b1dd231e5b09a401a5e215fe8da9521616bcc4","logical_entry_identity":"e3e9e6dc5043f41138215fb886e9938f8781144c8b7a50542742e2c999053a01","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"spellblaze","source_tag":"entity subtype","target":"魔法大爆炸"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"33cb58291f784b4e5c1e5cfdd94b20720cf66836dfb77f6e33d07bbdc35c65ae","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"cc3dccd024315afbfdfad27a9ea5986eafffa1a3a82c393c6f5319fea56d29ea","logical_entry_identity":"ff66a94db29d3d0242020adb0f5950fc71797b1c8fb69444931d47951996ff60","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#{italic}#(You see here a large, elaborate fountain.  A statue of Linaniil stands in the center, her arms outstretched to welcome all; around the outside of the fountain stand statues of a dwarf manipulating earthen runes, a human with a simple healer's crosier, an elf with a tall, elaborate staff, and a halfling with a scepter in one hand and a fireball hovering over the other.  The runes and the fireball are not connected to anything, and float in a fixed position in the air.  You see a carving repeating along the border of the fountain, in small print.)#{normal}#\n\nALL ARE WELCOME WHO LEARN FROM THE MISTAKES OF THE PAST\n\nLET THE ARCANE ONCE MORE BE A BOON AND NOT A BANE TO MAJ'EYAL\n\nALL ARE WELCOME WHO EASE THE SUFFERING OF THE PRESENT\n\nMAY WE HAVE THE WISDOM TO ONE DAY REUNITE THE WORLD IN SAFETY AND ENLIGHTENMENT\n\nALL ARE WELCOME WHO PREVENT THE THREATS OF THE FUTURE\n\nGATHER HERE IN PEACE TO DISCOVER AND PERFECT THE KNOWLEDGE OF HOW, AND WHEN, TO WEAVE THE WORLD'S FABRIC","source_tag":"_t","target":"#{italic}#（你在此看到一座庞大而精致的喷泉。莱娜尼尔的雕像站在中央，她伸展双臂，欢迎所有人；喷泉外缘周围站着几座雕像：一名操纵大地符文的矮人，一名持简朴治疗师权杖的人类，一名持高大精巧法杖的精灵，以及一名一手握着权杖、另一手上方悬浮火球的半身人。那些符文与火球未与任何东西相连，却保持在空中的固定位置。你看见喷泉边缘反复雕着一行细小字样。）#{normal}#\n\n欢迎所有从过去的错误中吸取教训之人\n\n愿奥术再度成为马基·埃亚尔的助益，而非灾祸\n\n欢迎所有缓解当下苦难之人\n\n愿我们拥有智慧，终有一日在安全与启蒙中使世界重新团结\n\n欢迎所有阻止未来威胁之人\n\n在此和平相聚，探索并完善何时、如何编织世界织物的知识"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"016dd300a99cabcec1a1c422b11ee9143fa0bfc5364b7a46b7a2b2dd5f62dda7","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"cc4250bce9cf24ad26e68528104547ed1e037328b53fd0723874ceebd01d1c75","logical_entry_identity":"70fb0f6863d6dc26b1c317bb64a1771049b939c054f5997879b01dc5ee8a0e22","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":" of acid","source_tag":"entity name","target":"强酸之"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"f57c5b69352720061d88c0aba9472a3e3d2653f7fd93dd67a2a952753f480b41","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"cc42cc486a519e8db5611c0bddb96769e3fa3114d8d2067fd4bd5bfa840f7c77","logical_entry_identity":"d76a031215048fb44b00c8e81c7ba2c40e402011afc8eb636870083332d273fb","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Mirth","source_tag":"calendar allied","target":"狂欢月"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"1ae9df298a2e56a07fd85a83bb0272ed9a808163f83f4482eed644fde3d08819","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"cc47c17806255196d53f69a49edd79f5befd76181225176d58177be7ecb2b204","logical_entry_identity":"d275b95325d8921765939c431fa31bf0ea3ea420a589c74939b0d44ca2495c98","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"If you can fetch me a still-beating orc heart, that would be even better. But you don't look like a master necromancer to me.","source_tag":"_t","target":"如果你能给我一个新鲜的、跳动着的兽人心脏，那就太好了。但是在我看来，你不像是一个死灵魔导师。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"f276f407ee291a9aa3c324255d028f60cf8e7f27b31bd0fe557d3a80b3f0a238","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"cc4adeeca35d0876fcdb47b90366d399181e4ce146c10aa5cce4c2e4ed4b8995","logical_entry_identity":"9e4fe49950e2b7b787224cc1912f23ff49285b227f01c2fade3c1acd9cb22892","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"+Wasting","source_tag":"_t","target":"+时间耗竭"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"03fec7b2ea32b80b58019e6825a7c05368ca90e92b03660374d9704b